    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Mentors should post project ideas to <a href=\"https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2016/wiki/table-of-proposed-coding-projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2016/wiki/table-of-proposed-coding-projects&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351604086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39RH_AQY9JZRHx9WS0cNol\">https://github.com/rstats-gsoc/gsoc2016/wiki/table-of-proposed-coding-projects</a> as soon as possible.<br><br>Students should begin working on project tests listed on the wiki. Once you have completed some tests, please add a link to your results on the wiki, and email the project mentors.<br><br>For those who have a blog on r-bloggers, can you please post a call for mentor and student participation?</div>"
    ],
